Z||000004||FieroMaster88||02-05-2001||01:58 AM||||That is a lot of money compared to what I spent on my 88.  Sure it is a coupe, but I got it in mint condition with all documentation, climate controlled storage for 4 or 5 years, rest of it's life inside, weekend driven with 27K miles for $4K!  Sure it is not a GT, but still could sell it for a lot more than $4K.  I love it a lot too.  GT would be nice, but $16K for a 88, too much IMO!  Maybe the $10K at the most!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">   <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles<BR>84 Indy Fiero (restoration Project)||||reg||1
